  translate_leg_pending
    defined-by answer
    role localized_response_template
    precondition "a requested leg inside a live direction is not materialized"
    effect "the plan-16 leaf that owes the leg is named with its leaf number"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "rust → js  pending (plan 16 L8)"
    lexeme en "translate leg pending report"
    lexeme ru "отчёт об ожидающем звене перевода"
    lexeme hi "अनुवाद चरण लंबित रिपोर्ट"
